d reclamation is out of scope for this strategy).\n51\t- Report is visible to administrators, project-scoped.\n52\t\n53\t## Acceptance Criteria\n54\t\n55\t- Given a project with workbenches, an administrator can open the\n56\t  idle-workbench report and see, per workbench: last activity, owner, and\n57\t  reserved resources (HLR-1).\n58\t- The report is scoped per project.\n59\t- Last-activity values shown in the report match the notebook controller's\n60\t  activity tracking.\n61\t- Owner and reserved-resource values shown in the report match the\n62\t  workbench's configuration.\n63\t- The report offers no reclamation or deletion action (out of scope).\n64\t\n65\t## HLR Traceability\n66\t\n67\t- HLR-1 (P1): the web console shows a per-project idle-workbench report (last\n68\t  activity, owner, reserved resources), sourced from the notebook controller's\n69\t  activity tracking.\n70\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-a5ea85c2d25cdaf4","agent_id":"a7f8fb6499b6cf050","session_id":"7da9b899-2570-4f45-9105-189f12061fa7","uuid":"7c9f0b26-3768-4083-b605-6cad9273d17b","timestamp":"2026-10-09T12:43:45.896Z","tool_result_meta":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-a70f1d42f3a47cc7","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}],"subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Review RHAISTRAT-9016 decomposition"}
